  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/659/659-57.htm",
  "statuteText": "659:57 Transfer of Checklist. –\n\nThe certified checklist shall be used to prepare the election return as provided in RSA 659:74 and shall then be delivered to the supervisors by the town or ward clerk."
